// Clue Name :
"P1287919462" "The slave's story"
// DetailString :
"P642884725" "One of the slaves you rescued told you: <br><br>'Thank you for my freedom, {HeroName}. There's someone else you should know about. Another of the Troll's slaves. They moved him to another location a few weeks ago, though I don't know why. To be honest, I fear for his life. Sam was his name. Sam Wincott.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Oog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P921010590" "Page from a strange diary"
// DetailString :
"P2733862878" "This tattered page reads: <br><br>'I am certain the Igneous creatures who chatter in my dreams are trying to tell me something. But what? I am learning more of their language. I believe the sound 'oog' means 'destroy.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Koago 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P4280483206" "This tattered page reads: <br><br>'Last night I dreamed of a sea of Magmites chanting the word 'Koago.' I don't understand how I know this, but I'm certain this word means 'leader.'"

