"P2720590347" "Listen up. You heard of Igneous, {HeroName}? Big, ugly dudes. No one know where they from. One thing I know: Trolls found whole cave full of rock dudes yesterday. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Probably you should clear out cave.</a> Good guys got enough to deal with: Trolls, Outcasts. Don't need Igneous mucking around here too."
